{"id":"Riven","key":"92","name":{"en":"Riven","zh_TW":"雷玟","zh_CN":"锐雯"},"title":{"en":"the Exile","zh_TW":"破刃放逐者","zh_CN":"放逐之刃"},"tags":["Fighter","Assassin"],"icon":"img/champion/Riven.png","passive":{"name":{"en":"Runic Blade","zh_TW":"符文破刃","zh_CN":"符文之刃"},"description":{"en":"Riven's abilities charge her blade, and her basic attacks expend charges to deal an additional damage.","zh_TW":"雷玟使用技能後，可將能量注入到刀中，讓她的基本攻擊獲得額外物理傷害。","zh_CN":"锐雯的技能会为她的剑刃充能，并且她的普通攻击会消耗充能来造成额外伤害。"},"icon":"img/passive/RivenRunicBlades.png"},"spells":[{"slot":"Q","name":{"en":"Broken Wings","zh_TW":"斷罪之翼","zh_CN":"折翼之舞"},"description":{"en":"Riven lashes out in a series of strikes. This ability can be reactivated three times in a short time frame with the third hit knocking back nearby enemies.","zh_TW":"雷玟使用一連串的攻擊。此技能能夠在短時間內連續使用 3 次，第三次的攻擊可以將鄰近敵人全數擊退。","zh_CN":"锐雯斩出一套猛烈的剑式。在短时间内，这个技能最多可以重新激活3次，并且第三次会将周围的所有敌人击飞。"},"cooldown":"13","cost":"0","range":"275","icon":"img/spell/RivenTriCleave.png"},{"slot":"W","name":{"en":"Ki Burst","zh_TW":"符文衝擊","zh_CN":"震魂怒吼"},"description":{"en":"Riven emits a Ki Burst, damaging and stunning nearby enemies.","zh_TW":"雷玟爆氣，造成傷害並且暈眩周圍敵人。","zh_CN":"锐雯爆发斗气，对附近敌人造成伤害和晕眩效果。"},"cooldown":"11/10/9/8/7","cost":"0","range":"260","icon":"img/spell/RivenMartyr.png"},{"slot":"E","name":{"en":"Valor","zh_TW":"勇者無敵","zh_CN":"勇往直前"},"description":{"en":"Riven steps forward a short distance and blocks incoming damage.","zh_TW":"雷玟向前衝刺一小段距離，並且抵擋接下來的傷害。","zh_CN":"锐雯向前冲锋一小段距离，并格挡即将到来的伤害。"},"cooldown":"10/9/8/7/6","cost":"0","range":"250","icon":"img/spell/RivenFeint.png"},{"slot":"R","name":{"en":"Blade of the Exile","zh_TW":"放逐之刃","zh_CN":"放逐之锋"},"description":{"en":"Riven empowers her keepsake weapon with energy, and gains Attack Damage and Range. During this time, she also gains the ability to use Wind Slash, a powerful ranged attack, once.","zh_TW":"雷玟使用能量強化武器，獲得物理攻擊與攻擊範圍加成。除此之外，在這段期間她可以使用一次強力的遠距離攻擊－暴風斬。","zh_CN":"锐雯将能量灌入她那残破不堪的武器中，使攻击力和攻击范围都得到提高。在这段时间里，她还能使用一次疾风斩（一次强大的远程打击）